[00:11.94]1. Nations are troubled as never before.
[00:24.30]People are fearful of what lies in store.
[00:30.50]Firm and immovable we need to be,
[00:36.12]Serving our God faithfully.
[00:42.58](Chorus)
[00:43.12]Steadfast we all need to be;
[00:49.04]Far from this world we keep free,
[00:55.76]Standing firm to the end,
[01:01.14]Unending life we’ll see.
[01:08.24]2. Snares of the world and temptations abound.
[01:08.46]We can resist if our thinking is sound.
[01:08.46]Hating what’s bad while we love what is true
[01:08.52]Makes us immovable too.
[01:45.78](Chorus)
[01:45.78]Steadfast we all need to be;
[01:50.68]Far from this world we keep free,
[01:57.28]Standing firm to the end,
[02:02.86]Unending life we’ll see.
[02:10.30]3. Give to God worship that comes from the heart.
[02:30.70]In the Lord’s service may we have a part.
[02:37.14]Preach the good news, always holding it fast.
[02:43.54]Soon the last days will have passed.
[02:50.82](Chorus)
[02:50.82]Steadfast we all need to be;
[02:55.84]Far from this world we keep free,
[03:03.40]Standing firm to the end,
[03:07.92]Unending life we’ll see.
